      "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Meeting agenda</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#eef5f0;color:#203c32;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;padding:48px}main{max-width:680px;margin:auto}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#527262}h1{font-size:48px;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:28px 0 12px}header p{font-size:19px;color:#526b5e;margin-bottom:36px}.item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:23px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbdccf}.number{font-size:14px;color:#60816d;padding-top:5px}h2{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 8px}.item p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#526b5e;margin:0}</style></head><body><main><header><div class=\"eyebrow\">STUDIO NOTES / 02</div><h1>Make room for what’s next.</h1><p>Meeting agenda · A clear path from idea to action</p></header><section class=\"item\"><span class=\"number\">01</span><div><h2>Review the direction</h2><p>What feels useful? What could be simpler?</p></div></section><section class=\"item\"><span class=\"number\">02</span><div><h2>Choose one focus</h2><p>Agree on the idea to explore together.</p></div></section><section class=\"item\"><span class=\"number\">03</span><div><h2>Set the next step</h2><p>Leave with a small, practical action.</p></div></section></main></body></html>",
